[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.495,
    "text": "Why does resting in your own home"
  },
  {
    "start": 1.5,
    "end": 2.8400000000000003,
    "text": "feel like getting caught?"
  },
  {
    "start": 3.68,
    "end": 4.34,
    "text": "Picture this."
  },
  {
    "start": 4.9,
    "end": 6.14,
    "text": "You hear keys at the front door."
  },
  {
    "start": 6.58,
    "end": 7.815,
    "text": "A second ago, you were watching a"
  },
  {
    "start": 7.82,
    "end": 8.18,
    "text": "movie."
  },
  {
    "start": 8.64,
    "end": 9.62,
    "text": "Now you're washing a plate."
  },
  {
    "start": 10.16,
    "end": 11.28,
    "text": "The plate was already clean."
  },
  {
    "start": 12.92,
    "end": 14.86,
    "text": "An hour earlier, this evening looked different."
  },
  {
    "start": 15.58,
    "end": 16.360000000000003,
    "text": "Dinner was done."
  },
  {
    "start": 16.66,
    "end": 17.860000000000003,
    "text": "The urgent stuff was handled."
  },
  {
    "start": 18.5,
    "end": 20.980000000000004,
    "text": "You texted a friend: finally, movie time."
  },
  {
    "start": 21.48,
    "end": 23.180000000000003,
    "text": "You made a snack, found the remote,"
  },
  {
    "start": 23.5,
    "end": 24.800000000000004,
    "text": "and gave yourself twenty minutes."
  },
  {
    "start": 25.76,
    "end": 27.215000000000003,
    "text": "Then you noticed your laptop was still"
  },
  {
    "start": 27.220000000000002,
    "end": 27.6,
    "text": "open."
  },
  {
    "start": 29.01,
    "end": 30.130000000000003,
    "text": "One unanswered email."
  },
  {
    "start": 30.81,
    "end": 32.23,
    "text": "It could wait until tomorrow."
  },
  {
    "start": 32.769999999999996,
    "end": 33.51,
    "text": "You knew that."
  },
  {
    "start": 33.71,
    "end": 35.33,
    "text": "But answering it would take two minutes."
  },
  {
    "start": 35.85,
    "end": 37.544999999999995,
    "text": "Then you could relax without it hanging"
  },
  {
    "start": 37.55,
    "end": 38.29,
    "text": "over you."
  },
  {
    "start": 38.79,
    "end": 40.845,
    "text": "You put the snack down, crossed the"
  },
  {
    "start": 40.85,
    "end": 42.35,
    "text": "room, and pulled the chair out."
  },
  {
    "start": 43.9,
    "end": 44.76,
    "text": "You sent the reply."
  },
  {
    "start": 45.62,
    "end": 46.84,
    "text": "Another message arrived."
  },
  {
    "start": 47.4,
    "end": 49.56,
    "text": "Apparently your inbox had learned to reproduce."
  },
  {
    "start": 50.08,
    "end": 51.2,
    "text": "You opened that one too."
  },
  {
    "start": 51.7,
    "end": 53.1,
    "text": "Now you needed a document."
  },
  {
    "start": 53.8,
    "end": 55.440000000000005,
    "text": "The document needed a correction."
  },
  {
    "start": 55.92,
    "end": 57.355,
    "text": "Your movie was still waiting for you"
  },
  {
    "start": 57.36,
    "end": 58.06,
    "text": "to press play."
  },
  {
    "start": 58.5,
    "end": 60.02,
    "text": "The snack was getting cold."
  },
  {
    "start": 61.1,
    "end": 61.78,
    "text": "Your phone rang."
  },
  {
    "start": 62.24,
    "end": 64.04,
    "text": "The timer. Twenty minutes were up."
  },
  {
    "start": 64.58,
    "end": 66.19500000000001,
    "text": "You had successfully completed your break"
  },
  {
    "start": 66.2,
    "end": 67.88,
    "text": "without experiencing any of it."
  },
  {
    "start": 68.52,
    "end": 70.675,
    "text": "You silenced the alarm and reached for"
  },
  {
    "start": 70.67999999999999,
    "end": 71.46,
    "text": "the laptop again."
  },
  {
    "start": 71.89999999999999,
    "end": 72.75999999999999,
    "text": "Just finish this."
  },
  {
    "start": 73.38,
    "end": 74.91499999999999,
    "text": "Then you could finally stop thinking about"
  },
  {
    "start": 74.91999999999999,
    "end": 75.24,
    "text": "work."
  },
  {
    "start": 77.03999999999999,
    "end": 77.91999999999999,
    "text": "Then your friend texted."
  },
  {
    "start": 78.53999999999999,
    "end": 80.495,
    "text": "They'd spent the afternoon lying around and"
  },
  {
    "start": 80.5,
    "end": 81.63999999999999,
    "text": "felt terrible about it."
  },
  {
    "start": 82.24,
    "end": 83.35999999999999,
    "text": "Your reply came easily:"
  },
  {
    "start": 83.78,
    "end": 84.41999999999999,
    "text": "you were exhausted."
  },
  {
    "start": 85.17999999999999,
    "end": 85.93999999999998,
    "text": "You needed a break."
  },
  {
    "start": 86.64,
    "end": 87.32,
    "text": "You hit send."
  },
  {
    "start": 87.89999999999999,
    "end": 89.935,
    "text": "A moment later, they asked: how's the"
  },
  {
    "start": 89.94,
    "end": 90.25999999999999,
    "text": "movie?"
  },
  {
    "start": 90.75999999999999,
    "end": 92.1,
    "text": "You looked at the untouched remote."
  },
  {
    "start": 93.72,
    "end": 95.88,
    "text": "You started typing: haven't earned it yet."
  },
  {
    "start": 96.30000000000001,
    "end": 96.88,
    "text": "Then stopped."
  },
  {
    "start": 97.64,
    "end": 99.2,
    "text": "You wouldn't actually send that."
  },
  {
    "start": 99.64,
    "end": 100.7,
    "text": "It sounded ridiculous."
  },
  {
    "start": 101.30000000000001,
    "end": 103.03500000000001,
    "text": "But looking at your evening, wasn't that"
  },
  {
    "start": 103.04,
    "end": 104.18,
    "text": "the rule you were following?"
  },
  {
    "start": 104.80000000000001,
    "end": 106.45500000000001,
    "text": "Your friend could rest because they were"
  },
  {
    "start": 106.46000000000001,
    "end": 106.84,
    "text": "tired."
  },
  {
    "start": 107.34,
    "end": 109.42,
    "text": "You needed evidence that you'd done enough."
  },
  {
    "start": 111.60000000000001,
    "end": 113.15500000000002,
    "text": "Maybe that's part of what makes rest"
  },
  {
    "start": 113.16000000000001,
    "end": 113.88,
    "text": "uncomfortable."
  },
  {
    "start": 114.66000000000001,
    "end": 116.65500000000002,
    "text": "If being useful has become a condition"
  },
  {
    "start": 116.66000000000001,
    "end": 118.46,
    "text": "for feeling okay about yourself,"
  },
  {
    "start": 119.2,
    "end": 121.48,
    "text": "an unfinished task can feel personal."
  },
  {
    "start": 122.36,
    "end": 123.88,
    "text": "The document can wait until morning."
  },
  {
    "start": 124.60000000000001,
    "end": 126.69500000000001,
    "text": "But can you feel okay about yourself"
  },
  {
    "start": 126.7,
    "end": 127.4,
    "text": "while it waits?"
  },
  {
    "start": 128.62,
    "end": 130.835,
    "text": "Research has linked seeing leisure as wasted"
  },
  {
    "start": 130.84,
    "end": 132.67999999999998,
    "text": "time with enjoying it less."
  },
  {
    "start": 133.54000000000002,
    "end": 135.38,
    "text": "That doesn't explain everyone's guilt."
  },
  {
    "start": 135.9,
    "end": 137.695,
    "text": "In this story, though, every attempt to"
  },
  {
    "start": 137.7,
    "end": 139.12,
    "text": "relax comes with an inspection:"
  },
  {
    "start": 139.82,
    "end": 141.07999999999998,
    "text": "have I justified this yet?"
  },
  {
    "start": 141.6,
    "end": 143.635,
    "text": "Imagine watching a movie while somebody keeps"
  },
  {
    "start": 143.64,
    "end": 144.9,
    "text": "asking for your receipt."
  },
  {
    "start": 146.76,
    "end": 148.45999999999998,
    "text": "Sometimes the pressure comes from outside."
  },
  {
    "start": 149.34,
    "end": 150.89999999999998,
    "text": "A boss expects evening replies."
  },
  {
    "start": 151.6,
    "end": 152.88,
    "text": "Housework isn't shared fairly."
  },
  {
    "start": 153.62,
    "end": 154.82,
    "text": "Someone depends on you."
  },
  {
    "start": 155.1,
    "end": 157.515,
    "text": "Those situations may need practical help or"
  },
  {
    "start": 157.51999999999998,
    "end": 157.92,
    "text": "boundaries."
  },
  {
    "start": 158.46,
    "end": 160.45999999999998,
    "text": "But tonight, the urgent work is done."
  },
  {
    "start": 161.0,
    "end": 162.375,
    "text": "Nobody has asked you to open that"
  },
  {
    "start": 162.38,
    "end": 163.11999999999998,
    "text": "laptop again."
  },
  {
    "start": 164.07999999999998,
    "end": 164.98,
    "text": "You look at the document."
  },
  {
    "start": 165.56,
    "end": 166.73999999999998,
    "text": "One correction can wait."
  },
  {
    "start": 167.11999999999998,
    "end": 168.67499999999998,
    "text": "You write yourself a note: fix this"
  },
  {
    "start": 168.67999999999998,
    "end": 169.71999999999997,
    "text": "tomorrow after breakfast."
  },
  {
    "start": 170.54,
    "end": 171.39999999999998,
    "text": "Then you close the laptop."
  },
  {
    "start": 172.07999999999998,
    "end": 173.255,
    "text": "You take the snack back to the"
  },
  {
    "start": 173.26,
    "end": 173.55999999999997,
    "text": "couch."
  },
  {
    "start": 174.23999999999998,
    "end": 176.33499999999998,
    "text": "This time, you press play before finding"
  },
  {
    "start": 176.33999999999997,
    "end": 177.55999999999997,
    "text": "another reason to leave."
  },
  {
    "start": 179.96,
    "end": 181.655,
    "text": "And right then, keys turn in the"
  },
  {
    "start": 181.66,
    "end": 181.98,
    "text": "door."
  },
  {
    "start": 182.76,
    "end": 183.6,
    "text": "Your shoulders tighten."
  },
  {
    "start": 184.29999999999998,
    "end": 185.57999999999998,
    "text": "The familiar thought arrives:"
  },
  {
    "start": 186.48,
    "end": 186.98,
    "text": "look busy."
  },
  {
    "start": 187.42,
    "end": 188.695,
    "text": "You hurry to the sink and grab"
  },
  {
    "start": 188.7,
    "end": 189.95999999999998,
    "text": "a plate from the drying rack."
  },
  {
    "start": 190.29999999999998,
    "end": 192.14,
    "text": "Under the running water, you notice it."
  },
  {
    "start": 192.46,
    "end": 193.88,
    "text": "This plate was already clean."
  },
  {
    "start": 196.3,
    "end": 197.28,
    "text": "Your roommate walks in."
  },
  {
    "start": 197.56,
    "end": 198.92,
    "text": "Hey. How was your night?"
  },
  {
    "start": 199.42000000000002,
    "end": 200.775,
    "text": "You almost say you were just cleaning"
  },
  {
    "start": 200.78,
    "end": 203.2,
    "text": "up. Instead, you turn off the faucet."
  },
  {
    "start": 203.5,
    "end": 204.46,
    "text": "Set the plate down."
  },
  {
    "start": 204.8,
    "end": 206.46,
    "text": "Your mouth starts forming an explanation."
  },
  {
    "start": 207.26000000000002,
    "end": 208.38,
    "text": "You let that go too."
  },
  {
    "start": 208.94,
    "end": 210.02,
    "text": "I was watching a movie."
  },
  {
    "start": 212.06,
    "end": 213.77999999999997,
    "text": "Any good? You shake your head."
  },
  {
    "start": 214.07999999999998,
    "end": 214.83999999999997,
    "text": "You don't know yet."
  },
  {
    "start": 215.01999999999998,
    "end": 215.95999999999998,
    "text": "You've barely started."
  },
  {
    "start": 216.32,
    "end": 217.29999999999998,
    "text": "You sit back down."
  },
  {
    "start": 217.92,
    "end": 219.255,
    "text": "Your roommate takes a piece of your"
  },
  {
    "start": 219.26,
    "end": 220.98,
    "text": "snack and heads down the hall."
  },
  {
    "start": 221.51999999999998,
    "end": 222.07999999999998,
    "text": "That's it."
  },
  {
    "start": 222.5,
    "end": 223.07999999999998,
    "text": "No inspection."
  },
  {
    "start": 223.64,
    "end": 224.935,
    "text": "You pick up the remote and find"
  },
  {
    "start": 224.94,
    "end": 225.48,
    "text": "your place."
  },
  {
    "start": 227.23999999999998,
    "end": 229.04,
    "text": "The guilt hasn't magically disappeared."
  },
  {
    "start": 229.7,
    "end": 230.99999999999997,
    "text": "Neither has tomorrow's work."
  },
  {
    "start": 231.5,
    "end": 233.33499999999998,
    "text": "But this time, you stay for the"
  },
  {
    "start": 233.33999999999997,
    "end": 233.92,
    "text": "next scene."
  },
  {
    "start": 234.35999999999999,
    "end": 234.95999999999998,
    "text": "Then the next."
  },
  {
    "start": 235.39999999999998,
    "end": 237.05999999999997,
    "text": "You let the movie hold your attention."
  },
  {
    "start": 237.95999999999998,
    "end": 239.61499999999998,
    "text": "And you let someone see you resting,"
  },
  {
    "start": 239.61999999999998,
    "end": 241.11499999999998,
    "text": "without trying to make it look like"
  },
  {
    "start": 241.11999999999998,
    "end": 241.79999999999998,
    "text": "something else."
  }
]
